# Copy to .env and fill in your own key. .env is gitignored.
# Get a key at https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
#
# WARNING: Vite inlines VITE_* variables into the public JS bundle at build
# time. Anyone who loads the site can read this key. Restrict it in Google
# Cloud (API + HTTP referrer restrictions) and keep a low quota cap, or move
# generation behind a server that holds the key instead.
VITE_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key-here
